{
 "id": 620048,
 "titulo": "2.7 Update Details (Updated)",
 "fecha": 1480993172046,
 "modificada": 1732665944612,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/620048",
 "html": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><img id=\"sY-vbrKbTt4\" class=\"youtube_thumb\" src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/sY-vbrKbTt4/sddefault.jpg\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" />&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">It&rsquo;s time to unveil the latest update for Marvel Future Fight. The 9 realms are in danger, and it is up to us to help save the world as we know it. Be prepared for some of the largest fights that have ever been seen in Marvel Future Fight. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"/article/detail?cafeId=futurefight_en&amp;bbsId=75&amp;id=418501\" target=\"_parent\">Can't see images because you're at work? Try this &#108;ink</a></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\"> 7 New Characters</span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">We could not defend the 9 realms without the help of other characters from Asgard and beyond. You will now be able to recruit Odin, Enchantress, Hela, Ulik, Fandral, Volstagg, and Hogun! </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2016/12/061032/01.png\" /><br /><!--[endif]--><!-- [if gte vml 1]></o:wrapblock><![endif]--></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2016/12/061032/02.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2016/12/061351/03.png\" /><br clear=\"ALL\" /><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana; color: red;\"> * Skill information is based on skill level 1.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #0070c0;\">&nbsp;* Odin Biometrics will be awarded once you have finished chapter 12-8, &ldquo;The Big Man&rdquo;. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #0070c0;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- Odin&rsquo;s Biometrics will not be able to be sold or used as experience for other characters. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 40.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #0070c0;\">- Odin is a base Tier 2 character. This means he will level up using Black Anti-matter, other character biometrics for experience and Chaotic Norn Stones for mastery. &nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #0070c0;\">&nbsp;* Ulik, Fandral, Volstagg, Hogun, and Hela will be available in Chapter&rsquo;s 11 and/or 12. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"color: #0070c0;\">&nbsp;* Enchantress will be available only in Get 20 Biometrics Daily that you can purchase in Shop.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: red;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"color: red;\">WHAT IS CANCEL RESIST?</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"color: red;\">Cancel resist is a resist to debuff skills.</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\">New Team Bonuses and Achievements have been added.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: red;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\"> 3 New Tier-2 Skills</span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">Thor, Sif and Captain Marvel will get their Tier-2 Skills.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2016/12/061032/04.png\" /><br /><!--[endif]--></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt; tab-stops: 105.75pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #0070c0;\">[Advancement?]</span></strong><br /> &nbsp; &nbsp;A character which is Advanced from Tier-1 to Tier-2 will gain a stat increase, as well as a new passive skill.<br /> <span style=\"color: #c00000;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">▣</span></strong></span><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"> 3 New Uniforms</span></span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 5.5pt; mso-char-indent-count: .5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">New Uniforms for Thor, Sif and Silk have been added. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2016/12/061032/05.png\" /><strong><br /><!--[endif]--></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 5.0pt; mso-para-margin-left: .5gd;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #0070c0;\">* New Uniforms will be on sale during the sales period.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #0070c0;\"><br /> <strong>* You will be available to check more details and see the changes in Marvel Universe and Uniform room.</strong></span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\"> New Chapters and Clear Ticket Changes</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;1. New Chapters</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; New Story Missions have been added. The 9 Realms are in trouble, and it falls to Earth&rsquo;s mightiest heroes to help save the day. Traverse across the 9 realms and help the Asgardians to restore peace and order to Yggdrasil! </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>&nbsp; - New Chapter 11-1 ~ 11-8, 12-1 ~ 12-8</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2016/12/061032/06.png\" /><br /><!--[endif]--></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;2. Increase in daily acquirable Biometrics in each stage. </strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">The amount of biometrics you can get daily from missions has been increased from 5 to 10. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2016/12/061032/07.png\" /><br /><!--[endif]--></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;3. Clear Ticket Changes</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;Use 10x Clear Ticket &#98;utton will now consume all 10 Clear Tickets immediately, instead of the previous system of consuming them after each use.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 11.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0; line-height: 70%;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 70%; color: #0070c0;\">※</span><span style=\"line-height: 70%; color: #0070c0;\"> 10xClear Ticket animation will remain the same.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 11.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0; line-height: 70%;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 70%; color: #0070c0;\">※</span><span style=\"line-height: 70%; color: #0070c0;\"> (AOS) Using Back &#66;utton will still give you 10 times of Clear Rewards.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\"> S.H.I.E.L.D. Level Increase </span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\">Maximum S.H.I.E.L.D. Level has been increased from 60 to 70. To fight against the rising threats, we have raised the S.H.I.E.L.D. level cap from 60<span lang=\"KO\">&rarr;</span>70. Use this extra power wisely!</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2016/12/061032/08.png\" /><strong><span style=\"color: #0070c0;\"><br /><!--[endif]--></span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #0070c0;\">&nbsp;- Energy cap will be increased based on S.H.I.E.L.D. Level. </span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #0070c0;\">&nbsp; Odin&rsquo;s Blessing will be available from S.H.I.E.L.D. Level 60!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\"> New Gear Enhancement Material - Uru</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;Uru has been added to help improve the power of your characters equipment.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;Once character&rsquo;s Gear is fully upgraded to 20, Odin&rsquo;s Blessing will be unlocked and slots will appear allowing you to equip Enchanted Uru.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2016/12/061032/09.png\" /><br /><!--[endif]--></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #0070c0;\">&nbsp;- Locked Uru Slots will be unlocked one by one from S.H.I.E.L.D. Level 60 up to 5 Slots of each gear, </span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2016/12/061032/10.png\" /><br /><!--[endif]--></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #0070c0;\">&nbsp;- Each Uru has its own special power. With Uru Amplification, you can increase its effects even more. </span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: red;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2016/12/061032/11.png\" /><strong><span style=\"color: #0070c0;\"><br /><!--[endif]--></span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #0070c0;\">&nbsp;- Clearing Chapters 11 or 12 Missions will allow you to gather Uru and Uru Enhancement material!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #0070c0;\">&nbsp;-Uru Enhancement can fail&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\"> New Content &ndash; World Boss Invasion</span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">Protect the world with other Agents! Real Time Co-Op World Boss Invasion has been added for epic battles! </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2016/12/061032/12.png\" /><br /><!--[endif]--></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;Enter the World Boss Invasion</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;You will require 3 Characters to enter World Boss Invasion. With 2 other Agents, there will be 9 Characters in one Mission. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana; color: red;\">&nbsp;Once your Characters have entered, they will not be useable again until the next World Boss Invasion is open.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: red;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2016/12/061032/13.png\" /><strong><span style=\"color: red;\"><br /><!--[endif]--></span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #c00000;\">&nbsp;</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #c00000;\">※</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #c00000;\"> Character &#83;election will not be limited. You will be able to use any Character you want.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;All Characters entered will be scaled on their level, mastery and skill levels to certain point. This means that non-6<span lang=\"KO\">★</span> Characters can be entered, and they will be automatically ranked up to help you take on the Invasion. &nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #0070c0;\">&nbsp;* Comic Cards, ISO-8, Custom Gear and Characters&rsquo; Gears works the same as usual. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2016/12/061032/14.png\" /><br /><!--[endif]--></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;Each stage has random goal to finish. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 5.5pt; mso-char-indent-count: .5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #0070c0;\">Example) </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 11.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #0070c0;\">* Boss Mode for an epic battle</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 11.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #0070c0;\">* Point Mode requires you to reach a certain amount of points to win</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 11.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #0070c0;\">* &#76;ink Mode which will share all your HP and fight against a strong Boss!</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;Rewards and Co-op Mission</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2016/12/061032/15.png\" /><br /><!--[endif]--></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;After beating a Boss, a Supply Chest will be obtained which has various kinds of items. Supply Chests require a certain amount of time to open, however it can be also be instantly opened by using Crystals. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2016/12/061032/16.png\" /><br /><!--[endif]--></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;Each World Boss Invasion will have Co-op Mission that will be shared with other Agents. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;Meet the requirements of each Co-op Mission to fill the bar, if you manage it completely fill the bar, you will be able to acquire a special reward once the World Boss Invasion resets at the end of the week. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #c00000;\">&nbsp;</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #c00000;\">※</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #c00000;\"> You must meet the successfully meet the requirement at least once to obtain the reward!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\"> Alliance Battle Challenge Mode</span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;Time to reach the maximum limit! Challenge Mode in Alliance Battle has been added for Score Attack! </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2016/12/061032/17.png\" /><strong><span style=\"color: #c00000;\"><br /><!--[endif]--></span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 5.5pt; mso-char-indent-count: .5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">You will be able to use the hero you already used in previous Extreme Mode.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;It will take certain amount of Gold as an entrance fee. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #c00000;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2016/12/061032/18.png\" /><strong><span style=\"color: #c00000;\"><br /><!--[endif]--></span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;You will not be able to earn rewards from scores however, if you score more than your first try in Extreme Mode, your score will be changed to the new highest score. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\"> Black Anti-Matter Dismantle and other changes</span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 5.5pt; mso-char-indent-count: .5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>1. Dismantle</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp; </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2016/12/061032/19.png\" /><br /><!--[endif]--></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp; You will be able to dismantle Rank 2 or higher Black Anti-Matter back to Rank 1 Black Anti-Matter. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp; Based on the rank of Black Anti-Matter, it will give back the same amount of Black Anti-Matter used to create it.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp; Its cost may change based on the rank of Black Anti-Matter.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;2. Easy access to control Black Anti-Matter </strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;You will be able to find the Material Processing &#98;utton in the Inventory Menu</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\"> Shadow Land Throne Changes</span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;1. Conditions for taking the Throne has Changed </strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; It no longer matters how many times the King in the Throne has defended his place, the challenger in First Place will take the throne after the time limit. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 70%;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 70%; color: #c00000;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"line-height: 70%; color: #c00000;\">※</span><span style=\"line-height: 70%; color: #c00000;\"> Condition changes will not affect the rewards. Rewards will remain the same. </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 70%;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 70%; color: #c00000;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"line-height: 70%; color: #c00000;\">※</span><span style=\"line-height: 70%; color: #c00000;\"> If there is no agent who has successfully challenged the throne, the one who had the throne will take the throne after reset as well. </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;2. Challenger Reward </strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2016/12/061032/20.png\" /><strong><br /><!--[endif]--></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 5.5pt; mso-char-indent-count: .5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>3. Retry &#66;utton Changes</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 16.5pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">If you retry the same floor after pressing the &lsquo;Retry&rsquo; &#98;utton or you were defeated on a floor, the Characters that were used will be &#115;elected in the character &#115;elect window. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 16.5pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">(you can change the characters normally). </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">▣</span></strong></span><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"> Character Balancing</span></span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 22.25pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong>1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong>Captain Marvel</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 40.25pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]-->A)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><!--[endif]-->Radiant Form</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 56.0pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]-->-<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><!--[endif]-->Skill Effect has been changed</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 40.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2016/12/061032/21.png\" /><br /><!--[endif]--></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 40.0pt; text-indent: .25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana; color: red;\">* Numbers are based on Skill Level 1.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 40.25pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]-->B)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><!--[endif]-->Binary Explosion</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 56.0pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]-->-<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><!--[endif]-->Immune to all damage (5 Sec.) has been added</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 40.25pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]-->C)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><!--[endif]-->After Radiant Form finishes, All Skills Cooldown time will no longer do a 1 second &#114;efresh. &nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: red;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 22.25pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong>2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong>Thor</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 40.25pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo4;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]-->A)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><!--[endif]-->Thundering Maelstrom</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 56.0pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]-->-<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><!--[endif]-->Guard 3 hits when the Skill is activated</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 22.25pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong>3.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong>Sif</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 40.25pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]-->A)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><!--[endif]-->Attack Edge</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 56.0pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]-->-<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><!--[endif]-->Skill Effect has been changed.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 38.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2016/12/061032/22.png\" /><br /><!--[endif]--></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 40.0pt; text-indent: .25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana; color: red;\">* Numbers are based on Skill Level 1.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 22.25pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong>4.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong>Wong</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 40.25pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo6;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]-->A)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><!--[endif]-->Mystic Wave</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 56.0pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]-->-<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><!--[endif]-->Fixed an issue where the projectile does not hit the target correctly</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 56.0pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 22.25pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong>5.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong>White Tiger</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 40.25pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo7;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]-->A)<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><!--[endif]-->Tiger Ambush</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 56.0pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]-->-<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><!--[endif]-->Fixed an issue where the projectile does not hit the target correctly</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\"> Other Changes</span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">1. Fixed an issue with &ldquo;Blind&rdquo; Crowd Control Effect where missed attack could still damage the target. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">2. Shop &#98;utton in Biometrics Acquire Window will show other menus as well.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">3. You will now be able to check other Agents&rsquo; Alliance Battle score and their rank in their Alliance. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">4. You will be able to check the pop-up window where you can find certain Items in Epic Quest Research.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">5. Orange dot on the SHIELD Lab Icon will show the dot once Anti-Matter Generator has fully generated Anti-Matter.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">6. Fixed an issue with First Clear Reward text showing incorrectly in certain situations. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">7. Fixed an issue with She-Hulk&rsquo;s Uniform where she has unintended text in her Uniform Bonus. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">8. Steps of Hero&rsquo;s Journey and Journey of Growth has been decreased for easy gaming experience for new Agents.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - Total Steps has been decreased from 60 to 30. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - Those who are already in a Journey will have their Journey rearranged with the new steps.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - Due to total Steps have been decreased, Rewards have increased as well.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 70%;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 70%; color: #c00000;\">※</span><span style=\"line-height: 70%; color: #c00000;\"> Those who already in Journey will get their missed rewards in their mail.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 22.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 70%;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 70%; color: #c00000;\">※</span><span style=\"line-height: 70%; color: #c00000;\"> Agents who already finish their Journey to become an expert agent will not be able to renter the Journey.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">9. Contribution Rewards in Alliance will reset</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 11.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;- You will be able to obtain all the rewards once.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">10. Alliance Achievements will reset after update</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - Those who acquired their rewards before the update will need to wait until server reset to be able to claim again.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">11. You will no longer be able to tap 2 skill &#98;uttons at the same time.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #ff6600;\">12. Alliance Notice in game will be reset.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>"
}